{{Economy of Balisca}}

The '''Bank of Balisca''' ({{lang-bl|link=no|Banc de Balisca}}), alternatively known as the '''Confederal Bank''' ({{Langx|bl|Banc Confederal}}) is the [[W:Central bank|central bank]] and sole [[W:Monetary authority|monetary authority]] for the [[Baliscan Confederation]] since 1838, issuing the [[Baliscan sol]]. The bank doesn't translate its name to English but uses its Baliscano name in all English communications.
